      `the lower age a Member State has provided by law` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the lower age a Member State has provided by law? Give a number.
      `consent is given or authorised by the holder of parental responsibility over the child` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that consent is given or authorised by the holder of parental responsibility over the child? Answer true or false.
