    `Art 8(1) the processing of a child's personal data meets the condition of Art 8(1)` `point (a) of Article 6(1) applies` `the information society services are offered directly to a child` `the age of the child in complete years` (`P1 controller age a Member State has provided` `a Member State has provided by law for a lower age` `the lower age a Member State has provided by law`) `consent is given or authorised by the holder of parental responsibility over the child`

