      `the data are processed by another person also subject to an obligation of secrecy under Union or Member State law or rules established by national competent bodies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data are processed by another person also subject to an obligation of secrecy under Union or Member State law or rules established by national competent bodies? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
