§§ `Article 10 -- criminal convictions and offences`

@export Under Article 10, as a controller, does my processing of criminal convictions data meet the condition of Article 10?
GIVEN `the personal data relate to criminal convictions and offences or related security measures` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the personal data relate to criminal convictions and offences or related security measures? Answer true or false.
      `the processing is based on Article 6(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is based on Article 6(1)? Answer true or false.
      `the processing is carried out under the control of official authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is carried out under the control of official authority? Answer true or false.
      `the processing is authorised by Union or Member State law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the processing is authorised by Union or Member State law? Answer true or false.
      `that law provides for appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of data subjects` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that that law provides for appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of data subjects? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 10, as a controller, does my processing of criminal convictions data meet the condition of Article 10` IS
    `Art 10 the processing of personal data relating to criminal convictions and offences or related security measures meets the condition of Art 10` `the personal data relate to criminal convictions and offences or related security measures` `the processing is based on Article 6(1)` `the processing is carried out under the control of official authority` `the processing is authorised by Union or Member State law` `that law provides for appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of data subjects`

@export Under Article 10, as a controller, is a comprehensive register of criminal convictions I keep kept only under the control of official authority?
GIVEN `the register is a comprehensive register of criminal convictions` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the register is a comprehensive register of criminal convictions? Answer true or false.
      `the register is kept under the control of official authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the register is kept under the control of official authority? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 10, as a controller, is a comprehensive register of criminal convictions I keep kept only under the control of official authority` IS
    `Art 10 the comprehensive register of criminal convictions is kept only under the control of official authority` `the register is a comprehensive register of criminal convictions` `the register is kept under the control of official authority`


§§ `Article 11 -- processing which does not require identification`

@export Under Article 11(1), as a controller, am I obliged to maintain, acquire or process additional information to identify the data subject?
GIVEN `the purposes for which the controller processes personal data do not or do no longer require the identification of a data subject by the controller` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the purposes for which the controller processes personal data do not or do no longer require the identification of a data subject by the controller? Answer true or false.
      `the additional information would be maintained, acquired or processed for the sole purpose of complying with this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the additional information would be maintained, acquired or processed for the sole purpose of complying with this Regulation? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 11(1), as a controller, am I obliged to maintain, acquire or process additional information to identify the data subject` IS
    `Art 11(1) the controller is obliged to maintain, acquire or process additional information in order to identify the data subject` `the purposes for which the controller processes personal data do not or do no longer require the identification of a data subject by the controller` `the additional information would be maintained, acquired or processed for the sole purpose of complying with this Regulation`

@export Under Article 11(2), as a controller, must I inform the data subject that I am not in a position to identify him or her, and have I?
GIVEN `the case is one referred to in paragraph 1` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the case is one referred to in paragraph 1? Answer true or false.
      `the controller is able to demonstrate that it is not in a position to identify the data subject` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the controller is able to demonstrate that it is not in a position to identify the data subject? Answer true or false.
      `it is possible to inform the data subject` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that it is possible to inform the data subject? Answer true or false.
      `the controller has informed the data subject accordingly` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the controller has informed the data subject accordingly? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE `Duty outcome`
DECIDE `Under Article 11(2), as a controller, must I inform the data subject that I am not in a position to identify him or her, and have I` IS
    `Art 11(2) the controller informs the data subject that it is not in a position to identify the data subject` `the case is one referred to in paragraph 1` `the controller is able to demonstrate that it is not in a position to identify the data subject` `it is possible to inform the data subject` `the controller has informed the data subject accordingly`

@export Under Article 11(2), as a controller, are Articles 15 to 20 disapplied for the data subject I cannot identify?
GIVEN `the case is one referred to in paragraph 1` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the case is one referred to in paragraph 1? Answer true or false.
      `the controller is able to demonstrate that it is not in a position to identify the data subject` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the controller is able to demonstrate that it is not in a position to identify the data subject? Answer true or false.
      `the data subject, for the purpose of exercising his or her rights under Articles 15 to 20, has provided additional information enabling his or her identification` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the data subject, for the purpose of exercising his or her rights under Articles 15 to 20, has provided additional information enabling his or her identification? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 11(2), as a controller, are Articles 15 to 20 disapplied for the data subject I cannot identify` IS
    `Art 11(2) Articles 15 to 20 are disapplied` `the case is one referred to in paragraph 1` `the controller is able to demonstrate that it is not in a position to identify the data subject` `the data subject, for the purpose of exercising his or her rights under Articles 15 to 20, has provided additional information enabling his or her identification`


§§ `Article 24 -- the responsibility of the controller`

@export Under Article 24(1), as a controller, do I implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation?
GIVEN `I took into account the nature of the processing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that I took into account the nature of the processing? Answer true or false.
      `I took into account the scope of the processing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that I took into account the scope of the processing? Answer true or false.
      `I took into account the context of the processing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that I took into account the context of the processing? Answer true or false.
      `I took into account the purposes of the processing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that I took into account the purposes of the processing? Answer true or false.
      `I took into account the risks of varying likelihood and severity for the rights and freedoms of natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that I took into account the risks of varying likelihood and severity for the rights and freedoms of natural persons? Answer true or false.
      `appropriate technical and organisational measures are implemented` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that appropriate technical and organisational measures are implemented? Answer true or false.
      `the measures ensure that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the measures ensure that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation? Answer true or false.
      `the measures make it possible to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the measures make it possible to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 24(1), as a controller, do I implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation` IS
    `Art 24(1) the controller implements appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure and to be able to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation` (`P1 controller matters of Art 24(1) shown` `I took into account the nature of the processing` `I took into account the scope of the processing` `I took into account the context of the processing` `I took into account the purposes of the processing` `I took into account the risks of varying likelihood and severity for the rights and freedoms of natural persons`) `appropriate technical and organisational measures are implemented` `the measures ensure that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation` `the measures make it possible to demonstrate that processing is performed in accordance with this Regulation`

@export Under Article 24(1), as a controller, are my measures reviewed and updated where necessary?
GIVEN `reviewing and updating the measures is necessary` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that reviewing and updating the measures is necessary? Answer true or false.
      `the measures have been reviewed and updated` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the measures have been reviewed and updated? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE `Duty outcome`
DECIDE `Under Article 24(1), as a controller, are my measures reviewed and updated where necessary` IS
    `Art 24(1) the measures are reviewed and updated where necessary` `reviewing and updating the measures is necessary` `the measures have been reviewed and updated`

@export Under Article 24(2), as a controller, do my measures include the implementation of appropriate data protection policies where proportionate?
GIVEN `implementing data protection policies is proportionate in relation to the processing activities` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that implementing data protection policies is proportionate in relation to the processing activities? Answer true or false.
      `the measures include the implementation of appropriate data protection policies by the controller` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the measures include the implementation of appropriate data protection policies by the controller? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE `Duty outcome`
DECIDE `Under Article 24(2), as a controller, do my measures include the implementation of appropriate data protection policies where proportionate` IS
    `Art 24(2) the measures include the implementation of appropriate data protection policies by the controller` `implementing data protection policies is proportionate in relation to the processing activities` `the measures include the implementation of appropriate data protection policies by the controller`

@export Under Article 24(3), as a controller, may my adherence to an approved code of conduct or certification mechanism be used as an element to demonstrate compliance?
GIVEN `the controller adheres to an approved code of conduct as referred to in Article 40` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the controller adheres to an approved code of conduct as referred to in Article 40? Answer true or false.
      `the controller adheres to an approved certification mechanism as referred to in Article 42` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case, for your processing, that the controller adheres to an approved certification mechanism as referred to in Article 42? Answer true or false.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 24(3), as a controller, may my adherence to an approved code of conduct or certification mechanism be used as an element to demonstrate compliance` IS
    `Art 24(3) adherence may be used as an element by which to demonstrate compliance with the obligations of the controller` `the controller adheres to an approved code of conduct as referred to in Article 40` `the controller adheres to an approved certification mechanism as referred to in Article 42`
